  <scopecontent id="087b7d5d99827f6a053b7963d832eae8">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This collection consists of maps and drawings of infrastructure within Acadia National Park, Maine. Most of the records were produced by the Historic American Engineering Record (HAER) for the National Park Service (NPS) Acadia Roads and Bridges Recording Program. Many of the maps are identified by their official HAER numbers (e.g., ME-11) and some are stamped "DRAFT" indicating they are preliminary versions.</p>  </scopecontent>
